      "translatedText": "*   `read()` Read the left and right wheel encoders, update the left and right wheel position/velocity\\.\n*   `diff_drive_controller.update()` Based on `/diff_drive_controller/cmd_vel` and wheel feedback, calculate the target speeds of the left and right wheels, and publish odometry\\.\n*   `write()` Write the target speeds of the left and right wheels to the motor driver board\\.",
